{"id":"question.physiology.cardiovascular.cardiac-output-venous-return.001","kind":"original_concept_question","lessonId":"physiology.cardiovascular.cardiac-output-venous-return","media":{"items":[{"diagramRef":"diagram.cardiac-venous-intersection","id":"question.physiology.cardiovascular.cardiac-output-venous-return.001.media.question-diagram","stage":"question","type":"diagram"},{"columns":[{"id":"c0","label":"항목"},{"id":"c1","label":"자료"}],"id":"question.physiology.cardiovascular.cardiac-output-venous-return.001.case0861","rows":[{"cells":["정맥환류","VR=7−Pra"],"id":"r0"},{"cells":["심박출량","CO=2+Pra"],"id":"r1"},{"cells":["정상상태 조건","VR=CO"],"id":"r2"}],"stage":"question","title":"관찰 및 검사 자료","type":"table"}],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0"},"options":[{"id":"A","text":"0mmHg, 7L/분"},{"id":"B","text":"2mmHg, 5L/분"},{"id":"C","text":"2.5mmHg, 4.5L/분"},{"id":"D","text":"5mmHg, 2L/분"},{"id":"E","text":"7mmHg, 0L/분"}],"prompt":"정맥환류와 심박출량의 수치를 각각 VR=7−Pra, CO=2+Pra로 나타낸 모형이 있다. Pra는 mmHg, 두 유량은 L/분 단위의 수치다. 정상상태에서 두 유량이 같아지는 Pra와 유량은?","verificationStatus":"editorial_draft_not_exam_validated"}